  "description": {
   "en": "\"The Dragon King saved me from a cold environment.\"\n\nSophia, a countess, was mistreated by her parents who favored her younger sister. On the day of the ceremony to certify her as a saint, she is finally sent away from her parents' house because her sister was chosen as a saint. In the midst of her despair, the legendary Dragon King suddenly appears.\n\"I have come for the saint who will be my bride.\"\nSophia turns out to be a saint with superlative power!\n\"I have waited for you for a long time, my dear wife...\"\n\nThe fierce approach by the dragon king Craig just won't stop! She begins her second life while being doted on by the Dragon King, her self-proclaimed husband!"
  },
